"id":"pcp.theorem-4.6","kind":"claim","label":"Theorem 4.6","locator":"Theorem 4.6, Section 4","source_id":"paper","statement":"**Theorem 4.6 (binary low-degree test; [ABSSW26, Theorem 4.1]).** Let $D=cb^c$ and $q\\ge10^6D^3$, and with $K$ as in (11) put $J=2((c+1)K+29)$ and $S=28+J$. If this test rejects $(f,f')$ with probability $\\kappa$ and $J\\kappa\\le1/(4\\cdot10^6)$, then some polynomial $P$ of total degree at most $D$ has $\\Delta_{\\rm full}(f,\\mathcal H_r(P))\\le S\\kappa$ and $\\Delta_{\\rm hom}(f,\\mathcal H_r(P))\\le S\\kappa$.","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:0544eb2e356b797914aa8df20ae92a44b0ba8dc80a1f381430efc8a71213a44d/nodes/pcp.theorem-4.6","relations":[{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:0544eb2e356b797914aa8df20ae92a44b0ba8dc80a1f381430efc8a71213a44d/nodes/pcp.claim-source-12","id":"sha256:0544eb2e356b797914aa8df20ae92a44b0ba8dc80a1f381430efc8a71213a44d/edges/%5B%22pcp.claim-source-12%22%2C%22pcp.theorem-4.6%22%2C%22supports%22%5D","kind":"supports","record_ref":"sha256:0544eb2e356b797914aa8df20ae92a44b0ba8dc80a1f381430efc8a71213a44d/edges/%5B%22pcp.claim-source-12%22%2C%22pcp.theorem-4.6%22%2C%22supports%22%5D","semantic_class":"curated_argument_support","to":"sha256:0544eb2e356b797914aa8df20ae92a44b0ba8dc80a1f381430efc8a71213a44d/nodes/pcp.theorem-4.6"},{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:0544eb2e356b797914aa8df20ae92a44b0ba8dc80a1f381430efc8a71213a44d/nodes/pcp.theorem-4.6","id":"sha256:0544eb2e356b797914aa8df20ae92a44b0ba8dc80a1f381430efc8a71213a44d/edges/%5B%22pcp.theorem-4.6%22%2C%22lean.PCP.Algebraic.EncodedLineLowDegreeTest.exists_close%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","kind":"formalizes","record_ref":"sha256:0544eb2e356b797914aa8df20ae92a44b0ba8dc80a1f381430efc8a71213a44d/edges/%5B%22pcp.theorem-4.6%22%2C%22lean.PCP.Algebraic.EncodedLineLowDegreeTest.exists_close%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","semantic_class":"formalization_correspondence","to":"sha256:0544eb2e356b797914aa8df20ae92a44b0ba8dc80a1f381430efc8a